<</A 3173 0 R/Alt(Figure B.3 Turbidity profile of SAMBR; \(a\) stages A-1 to C; \(b\) stages D to F; \(c\) stages G to H-2 of testing. Each subplot shows turbidity \(NTU\) over time \(days\). Subplot \(a\) includes stages A-1, A-2, B, and C with vertical lines marking stag\
e transitions. Subplot \(b\) includes stages D, E, and F with vertical lines marking stage transitions. Subplot \(c\) includes stages G, H-1, H-2, and a stand-by operation period, with vertical lines marking stage transitions.)/C/adbe_style_002000/ID 3174 0 R/K 0/P 29 0 R/Pg 2171 0 R/S/Figure>>
endobj
