endobj
2030 0 obj
<</A 3177 0 R/Alt(TMP profile of SAMBR showing different stages labeled from A-1 to H-2 over time in days. The y-axis represents TMP in bars, ranging from 0.0 to 1.0. Each stage is marked with a number in parentheses indicating the specific day it starts. There are fluctua\
tions in TMP values throughout the stages, indicated by connected data points.)/C/adbe_style_001000/ID 3178 0 R/K 0/P 29 0 R/Pg 2172 0 R/S/Figure>>
endobj
